    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280860/extras/a4d6f80e7438d506cc31b95595800e29.avif?t=1740728362\" width=615 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DUEL TO THE HOLES</strong> is the ultimate parody you didn\u2019t know you needed\u2014a bold, over-the-top visual novel packed with action, insane anime moments, and shamelessly wild futa battles. This game takes all the epic intensity and cranks it up to levels you won\u2019t believe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280860/extras/30d30d8660aaaad94cc536b3d3fa4d8b.avif?t=1740728362\" width=615 height=270 /></span><strong>WHOA, WHOA, WHOA! What is this madness?!</strong> It\u2019s the wildest, most hardcore futa adventure you\u2019ve ever seen! Prepare for duels so outrageous they\u2019ll leave you speechless. We\u2019re talking jaw-dropping power-ups, gravity-defying moves, and absurdly massive... weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280860/extras/c27650be9cb93cc1b7aa8cc41e3c5e4b.avif?t=1740728362\" width=615 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where strength and lust collide, the most badass fighters are dueling not just for victory, but for total domination in the most outlandish, NSFW ways imaginable! Enter our heroines\u2014larger-than-life futas with attitude and \u201cskills\u201d to match. Whether it\u2019s an epic showdown or a ridiculous challenge, <strong>DUEL TO THE HOLES</strong> will pull you deep into its universe of outrageous battles and jaw-dropping encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280860/extras/1ff6de89206e72aff6157d78f9caaeb9.avif?t=1740728362\" width=614 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the duels intensify, so does the absurdity, pushing the limits of what's possible. Each battle escalates with wild new twists, where nothing is off the table and everything is unexpected.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280860/extras/5b36261bdfa39d845bc45751c22aa9d0.avif?t=1740728362\" width=615 height=180 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic  Moments</strong>: Explosive battles, intense showdowns, and dramatic power-ups straight out of your favorite anime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bold Futa Action</strong>: Prepare for some of the most daring, shameless, and wildly creative futa encounters you\u2019ve ever seen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outrageous Humor</strong>: Dumb jokes, ridiculous situations, and over-the-top moments that will keep you entertained.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Energy Visuals</strong>: Stunning HD renders that make every moment more intense and immersive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-Hand Playability</strong>: Whether it's for gameplay or giggles, you'll have a free hand at all times.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s fast, it\u2019s wild, it\u2019s outrageous\u2014DUEL TO THE HOLES is the anime-style futa experience you didn\u2019t know you needed but can\u2019t live without. Ready for the craziest showdown of your life?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280860/extras/a4d6f80e7438d506cc31b95595800e29.avif?t=1740728362\" width=615 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DUEL TO THE HOLES</strong> is the ultimate parody you didn\u2019t know you needed\u2014a bold, over-the-top visual novel packed with action, insane anime moments, and shamelessly wild futa battles. This game takes all the epic intensity and cranks it up to levels you won\u2019t believe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280860/extras/30d30d8660aaaad94cc536b3d3fa4d8b.avif?t=1740728362\" width=615 height=270 /></span><strong>WHOA, WHOA, WHOA! What is this madness?!</strong> It\u2019s the wildest, most hardcore futa adventure you\u2019ve ever seen! Prepare for duels so outrageous they\u2019ll leave you speechless. We\u2019re talking jaw-dropping power-ups, gravity-defying moves, and absurdly massive... weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280860/extras/c27650be9cb93cc1b7aa8cc41e3c5e4b.avif?t=1740728362\" width=615 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where strength and lust collide, the most badass fighters are dueling not just for victory, but for total domination in the most outlandish, NSFW ways imaginable! Enter our heroines\u2014larger-than-life futas with attitude and \u201cskills\u201d to match. Whether it\u2019s an epic showdown or a ridiculous challenge, <strong>DUEL TO THE HOLES</strong> will pull you deep into its universe of outrageous battles and jaw-dropping encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280860/extras/1ff6de89206e72aff6157d78f9caaeb9.avif?t=1740728362\" width=614 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the duels intensify, so does the absurdity, pushing the limits of what's possible. Each battle escalates with wild new twists, where nothing is off the table and everything is unexpected.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280860/extras/5b36261bdfa39d845bc45751c22aa9d0.avif?t=1740728362\" width=615 height=180 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic  Moments</strong>: Explosive battles, intense showdowns, and dramatic power-ups straight out of your favorite anime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bold Futa Action</strong>: Prepare for some of the most daring, shameless, and wildly creative futa encounters you\u2019ve ever seen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outrageous Humor</strong>: Dumb jokes, ridiculous situations, and over-the-top moments that will keep you entertained.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Energy Visuals</strong>: Stunning HD renders that make every moment more intense and immersive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-Hand Playability</strong>: Whether it's for gameplay or giggles, you'll have a free hand at all times.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s fast, it\u2019s wild, it\u2019s outrageous\u2014DUEL TO THE HOLES is the anime-style futa experience you didn\u2019t know you needed but can\u2019t live without. Ready for the craziest showdown of your life?</p>",
